Package: dtsus
Title: Download, Index and Process Brazilian Public Health Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(person("Lucas", "Fontes", email = "lucasrodriguesfontes@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Raquel", "Schneider", email = "raquelschneider03@gmail.com", role = "aut"))
Description: Tools to discover, download and process public Brazilian
    health data. The package provides access to DATASUS microdata and
    complementary public data sources used in health analyses, including
    beneficiary data from the Brazilian National Supplementary Health
    Agency (ANS). Functions support file listing, batch downloads, reading
    DBC files, filtering records, selecting variables and reproducible
    data processing workflows.
